  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standalone Mini-Grid Construction Project in Abuja, Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will construct solar power plants in two villages near Abuja, Nigeria, that are not connected to the electricity grid. These plants will provide independent electricity supply, be managed through an integrated control center to ensure sustainability, and include training on solar power plant management technology</narrative>
  </description>
